%% MediTriage AI — core flow (Mermaid)
flowchart LR
    A[Landing] --> B[Login / OTP]
    B --> C{New user?}
    C -->|yes| D[Signup · role select]
    C -->|no| E[Patient dashboard]
    D --> E
    E --> F[AI Assistant · voice/text]
    F --> G[Symptoms confirmed]
    G --> H[Triage result · explainable]
    H -->|Routine| H1[Self-care guidance]
    H -->|Moderate/Urgent| I[Doctor search + map]
    I --> J[Doctor profile + availability]
    J --> K[Booking · lock slot]
    K -->|409 conflict| K1[Offer nearest slots]
    K1 --> K
    K --> L[Success + booking ID]
    L --> M[Waiting room · device check]
    M --> N[WebRTC video consult]
    N --> O[AI summary drafted]
    O --> P[Doctor reviews & signs]
    P --> Q[Records timeline + e-Rx]
    Q --> R[Follow-up reminders]

    S[Offline anywhere] -.queue.-> F
    S -.cached.-> Q
    F -.sync when online.-> G
